summary: 'Founder-requested honest full-team assessment of the entire Warpline idea (Arky/Aegis/North/Scout/Mika/Loid/Jinx, orch-mr34gttt-1rg6, panel lore L-2026-07-02-ascend-063903-001). Convergent verdict across 7 independent contexts: the validated artifact is a meaning-level JUDGMENT LAYER for agent swarms (Guard/oracle + admit protocol), not a git replacement — replacement priced 2-4/10 everywhere, judgment layer 6-7/10. Official thesis reworded: "meaning decides, bytes record" (Arky). Founder ratified the revised sequence and execution begins now.'
